----------------------------------------------------------------12.09.2005--

Major update: Combat System
 * Hit/miss calculation improved
 * Weapons scaled based on damage done and combat speed
 * Most previously reported bugs

* Treasure items now load properly...go find 'em!
* The newbie command is no more, gossip to your heart's content.
* Proper display of extra descriptions (for objs) for MXP clients.
* Keys should start appearing more often, based on their load rate.
* Non-castable spells should now work as advertised.
* Ferrenx should return your identified items normally, or drop them on
  the ground if your hands are full.
* Containers should be fixed - please see a staff member to get them
  replaced!
* Your stats have been reduced by 5 points each to align with the new
  system being put in place.

----------------------------------------------------------------10.13.2005--

Happy Halloween!

We've added some new spells and skills: Group protection from evil and
good, entrapment and refuge. Keep the ideas coming!

----------------------------------------------------------------------------
----------------------------------------------------------------10.13.2005--

Bug fixes continue! Thanks to everyone that keeps reporting bugs!

We now have some web forums up at http://www.darkpawns.com/forums

----------------------------------------------------------------------------
----------------------------------------------------------------10.01.2005--

3.0 Beta is here! Expect a number of changes over the coming weeks as a
lot of the remaining bugs are ironed out and new functionality is added.

